<meta name='title' content='Powers of Ten for X3D: the Drillfield to the stars'/>
<meta name='description' content='One continuous zoom from Burruss Hall to 50 light-years, at real positions for 13 October 2026 15:00 UTC (Web3D 2026, Doha, opening day). Scene frame: east-up-south at the Drillfield. No Script node: one TimeSensor drives interpolators and sequencers; a page can scrub the same drivers with set_fraction.'/>
